          "display_title": "Required POC Content Elements",
          "learner_facing_content": "Diagnoses, measurable goals, interventions, disciplines, frequency, and duration must be explicit.\nSafety risks, homebound support, and discharge planning must be addressed when applicable.\nMissing required elements can invalidate necessity narrative and delay compliant billing.",
