          "learner_facing_content": "Unchanged goals across episodes can signal poor clinical reassessment and weak necessity support.\nRecert content must show progress, barriers, and revised interventions where indicated.\nRecertification should document why continued skilled services remain reasonable and necessary.",
          "learning_goal": "Prevent recertification failures caused by stale goals or unchanged rationale.",
          "why_it_matters": [
            "Common denial pattern: recert narrative does not match visit-level documentation."
          ],
