          "display_title": "Homebound Defensibility Examples",
          "learner_facing_content": "Strong: specific functional limitations, assistive needs, symptom burden, and safety risk context.\nWeak: broad statements without objective function or symptom support.\nDefensible homebound documentation should be longitudinally consistent across episodes.",
