          "display_title": "Interim Order Governance",
          "learner_facing_content": "Interim orders should reflect current condition and be integrated into the active plan.\nOrder updates must be visible across scheduling, documentation, and QA workflows.\nAging queues and escalation thresholds reduce unresolved-order risk.",
