          "display_title": "Survey Deficiency Pattern: Weak Coordination Challenge",
          "learner_facing_content": "During a survey, the reviewer asks for evidence of interdisciplinary coordination. The agency provides a sign-in sheet from a team meeting but no documentation linking the discussion to specific care decisions, plan updates, or role assignments.",
