          "display_title": "Audit Trigger: Storyline Inconsistency Challenge",
          "learner_facing_content": "A patient OASIS assessment documents severe functional limitations requiring maximum assist for all transfers. Three days later, the nursing visit note states the patient is \"independent with all ADLs and ambulating without difficulty.\" No clinical event or intervention explains the change.",
