          "display_title": "Defensibility Checklist: Pre-Bill",
          "learner_facing_content": "Signatures complete and dated; verbal/interim orders resolved.\nRequired POC elements present, patient-specific, and measurable.\nSkilled need and homebound rationale are explicit and current.",
